# The User Manual, in order. THIS IS THE ONLY PLACE THE ORDER IS DECLARED.
#
# The chapter files are deliberately not numbered. `07-configuring.md` looks tidy right up
# to the morning you insert a chapter at 04 and rename eleven files, breaking every
# cross-link in the document and every link anyone ever made to it. The sequence is data,
# so it lives in a file, and the build reads it.
#
# Anything under ref/ is GENERATED from the binary. Do not edit those by hand; run
# `cmake --build build --target docs-reference`.

introduction.md

# The release notes are NOT here. They used to be a chapter (whats-new.md), but a document
# that describes the program AS IT IS ages badly with a chapter that describes what CHANGED --
# by 0.4.0 the manual carries three of them. So the notes ship as their own document now,
# docs/changelog/ -> altairsim-changelog.pdf, beside the manual in the package. (2026-07-21.)
package.md
running.md
quick-start.md

# The cheat sheet sits here on purpose -- BEFORE the detail. It is the page you keep open
# on a second screen, and a reader who only ever reads to here can still drive the machine.
